  "script": "A monstrous 510 horsepower, wrapped in aggressive bodywork. That\u2019s the C63 AMG Black Series. Power and style in one package. In 2012, Mercedes produced just 800 of these beasts. It\u2019s a rare gem in the AMG lineup. Under the hood, a 6.2-liter V8 delivers 457 lb-ft of torque. Pure power to the rear wheels. It boasts forged pistons, connecting rods, and a crankshaft borrowed from the SLS AMG. Built for serious performance. Originally started at around $135K new, but you can find one for about $90K now. A machine with a 7,200 rpm redline. Inside, it focuses on the driver. Heated seats, carbon fiber trim, and a Harman/Kardon sound system are standard. The real question: Would you choose raw, rare excitement or stick to something more conventional? What's your side?",
